#EXTM3U
# Example of a channel list. Copy to channels/<group-name>.m3u and fill in real addresses.
# Every channel = two lines: #EXTINF with the name, and below it the stream address.
# Optional: lang="xx" (used with USE_PLAYLIST_LANG=1), tvg-logo="...", http-user-agent="...".
# Fetch public lists: ./scripts/fetch-channels.sh <group-name> <country/language/category>
#EXTINF:-1 lang="en" tvg-logo="https://example.invalid/logo.png",English news channel
https://example.invalid/english/live/index.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 lang="es",Spanish channel
https://example.invalid/spanish/live/index.m3u8
